{"unit_id":"qwert702__dsh-context-compressor#feature-1","repo":"qwert702/dsh-context-compressor","commit":"cde9a0b577c177b054f4d5c2d9578cb0a6d35222","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-compressor 的功能「会话栏手动压缩」：在会话标题栏显示压缩按钮，空白或已移除会话不显示，运行中、待提交或尚未打开的会话禁用按钮；点击后先要求确认。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:160-223"]}
{"unit_id":"qwert702__dsh-context-compressor#feature-2","repo":"qwert702/dsh-context-compressor","commit":"cde9a0b577c177b054f4d5c2d9578cb0a6d35222","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-compressor 的功能「生成会话摘要」：确认后读取当前会话可回放的消息，按 maxInputChars 保留较新的内容，并调用会话路由的模型生成紧凑中文要点。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:189-204","lib/index.js:249-279"]}
